      "entity_type": "NPC",
      "name": "Spark Mage Ilya",
      "description": "A wiry mage with a blue-streaked braid and a singed casting glove. Friendly and chatty before a bout, she becomes spirited and competitive once combat begins, relying on lightning bolts and magical self-healing.",
      "appearance": "wiry female mage, dark braid with electric blue streak, singed leather glove, battlemage tunic",
